.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-EVAL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-eval
.Nd run multi-agent evaluation tasks
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead eval
.Op Cm list
.Nm egghead eval
.Cm run Ar task-id
.Op Fl -roster Cm user | task
.Op Fl -judge Ar agent-id
.Op Fl -timeout Ar seconds
.Nm egghead eval
.Cm runs
.Nm egghead eval
.Cm report Ar run-id
.Nm egghead eval
.Cm compare Ar run-a Ar run-b
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Cm eval
posts a task prompt into an ephemeral chat room, waits for the
conversation to converge, grades the resulting transcript with a
synthetic Judge agent, and writes a durable run record. The grading
methodology is ported from
.Lk https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.01935 "MultiAgentBench (MARBLE)" ,
so the numbers in a run record line up methodologically with the
published literature.
.Pp
Each run produces two records: the conversation as a
.Cm class: transcript
record, and a durable run record at
.Pa eval-runs/<timestamp>-<hash>
tagged
.Sy [eval, run, <category>] ,
with KPI and per-dimension scores in the frontmatter and a
milestone breakdown in the body.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "compare a b"
.It Cm list
List bundled tasks, grouped by category, with required capabilities.
Default when no subcommand is given.
.It Cm run Ar task-id
Run a task against a roster. By default, every
.Cm class: agent
record in the store joins the room.
.It Cm runs
List past run records.
.It Cm report Ar run-id
Re-render the run record's KPI summary, per-dimension scores, and
milestone breakdown.
.It Cm compare Ar run-a Ar run-b
Write a comparison record covering the two runs side by side. Useful
for A/B-testing roster changes against the same task.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--timeout n"
.It Fl -roster Cm user | task
Select who participates in the run.
.Cm user
.Pq the default
joins every
.Cm class: agent
record from your store.
.Cm task
spawns transient agent processes from personas declared by the task
itself; those agents live only for the duration of the run, are
never written to the records directory, and disappear when the room
stops. Use
.Cm task
to compare your own roster against the task's reference roster on
the same prompt.
.It Fl -judge Ar agent-id
Override the Judge agent. Defaults to the bundled Judge defined by
the task.
.It Fl -timeout Ar seconds
Wall-clock cap on a run.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead eval list
egghead eval run research/profile-1
egghead eval run research/profile-1 --roster task
egghead eval runs
egghead eval report 2026-04-15-abc123
egghead eval compare 2026-04-15-abc123 2026-04-16-def456
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-agents 1 ,
.Xr egghead-rooms 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1 ,
.Xr egghead 7
